confirmed that the inference code he wrote and the parameters he trained are available under Apache-2.0. This
notice is attribution only and does not imply endorsement by the REAL-TSE organizers.

wesep/ is the WeSep model code from the REAL-TSE challenge baseline (https://github.com/REAL-TSE/wesep-real-tse),
Apache-2.0 per its source headers, used unchanged.

demo/ort/ is ONNX Runtime Web 1.20.1 (https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime), MIT License, Copyright Microsoft.

